<http://example.org/sen0414/ch02/tbox> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "SEN0414 chapter 2 domain ontology - TBox"@en ; owl:versionInfo "1.1.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414/ch02/tbox/1.1.0> ; rdfs:comment "1.1.0 adds the concepts that the text of 1.0.0 used or needed without explaining them (the keyword, the statement, program execution, the flowchart, indentation, the clause, None, sequences and collections, identity, binary and unary operators, the truth table, operand results, the kinds of error and the traceback, among others), keeps every earlier concept and its identifier, and rewrites every explanation as four to six paragraphs of continuous prose; added concepts and a rewrite of the text, so MINOR."@en ;
